Occasionally; blessed scrolls of identify have a larger chance than
uncursed scrolls to identify your full inventory, but it's by no means
guaranteed. Even an uncursed scroll does it sometimes. Cursed scrolls
of identify, however, always identify only one item, and if you're
confused any scroll of identify identifies only itself ("You identify
this as an identify scroll").

If you have a magic marker and blank paper you can write your own, of
course. If one is blessed and the other at least uncursed (doesn't
matter which), the scrolls will be blessed.

